Dear Dr. Bankole,

Thank you for evaluating Mr. Mensah, an 82-year-old man with diabetic kidney disease (microalbuminuria 2049, proteinuria July 2053), now CKD stage 4 since 7/29/2054, hypertriglyceridemia, hx STEMI 3/7/2017 and CABG 12/18/2045. On epoetin (8/19/2054). eGFR trending down. He wishes to be listed.

