He fasts on the 14th of each month for church. Transport by son's car, plate MD 3KF 9820.
Alcohol: unhealthy use in May 2052, now abstinent.

Awaiting your assessment. 
Yours,
Ruth Silver, MD       Electronically signed 11/04/2054 09:30
